 "notes": [
  "Qty 61: the list totals 60 as published (headers 9+21+17+11+2); the post's addendum says 'I'm not sure if I typed Ability Ability Ability in but if it isn't on the list then take out a pilot'. It is not on the list, so Ability, Ability, Ability is added; the pilot to take out is not named, so none is removed.",
  "Starting location marked '(SL)': Death Star; no Objective.",
  "Posted 'CC Lambda shuttle grabbing pilot guy' dested Commander Desanne (Cloud City Imperial pilot who takes a Lambda shuttle into hand from Reserve Deck); 'CC DTP' Cloud City: Downtown Plaza; 'CC PTDistrict' Cloud City: Port Town District; 'Choke Vader' Darth Vader, Dark Lord Of The Sith; 'Bus' Bossk In Hound's Tooth; 'V's Shuttle' Vader's Personal Shuttle; 'Warrent Officer M'kae' Warrant Officer M'Kae; 'ABC2 The Universe' A Bright Center To The Universe; 'CBHYBC' Come Here You Big Coward; 'Hell2Pay' There'll Be Hell To Pay.",
  "Tempest Scout 1 is listed twice (two lines), dested as posted. Secret Plans, Come Here You Big Coward and Battle Order are the pre-Reflections III Effects.",
  "The post also says 'I'm also trying to fit in an Imperial Decree' (not applied). A later version, 'Final- The Emperor s War Machine' (DeckTech 732, 3 October 1999), is a different list."
 ],
